@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Pengguna as User
boundary HalamanProfilMemberUI as ProfilUI
control ProfilController as Controller
entity ProfilProvider as Profil

== Main Flow ==

User -> ProfilUI : 1: Buka profil member dari beranda, artikel, atau direktori member
activate ProfilUI
ProfilUI -> Controller : 1.1: muatProfilMember(memberId)
activate Controller
Controller -> Profil : 1.1.1: ambilProfilMember(memberId)
activate Profil
Profil --> Controller : 1.1.2: Data profil member
Controller -> Profil : 1.1.3: ambilArtikelMember(memberId)
Profil --> Controller : 1.1.4: Daftar artikel member
Controller -> Profil : 1.1.5: ambilPortofolioMember(memberId)
Profil --> Controller : 1.1.6: Daftar portofolio member
Controller --> ProfilUI : 1.1.7: Data profil lengkap
ProfilUI --> User : 1.1.8: Tampilkan halaman profil member\n(header profil, statistik, daftar artikel, daftar portofolio)

alt [Pengguna membuka profil sendiri]
    ProfilUI --> User : 1.1.8a: Tampilkan tombol Edit Profil dan Kelola Artikel
end

deactivate Profil
deactivate Controller
deactivate ProfilUI

@enduml
